32	 *
33	 * OpenCode is an open-source AI coding agent for the terminal with support for 75+ LLM providers.
34	 *
35	 * Key features:
36	 * - Client-server architecture with local server management
37	 * - Support for 75+ LLM providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, Ollama, etc.)
38	 * - Built-in tools (bash, read, write, edit, grep, glob, etc.)
39	 * - Session-based conversations with persistence
40	 * - MCP server integration
41	 * - Custom agent definitions
42	 *
43	 * Default configurations:
44	 * - No working_dir: Runs in temp directory with no tools (chat-only mode)
45	 * - With working_dir: Runs in specified directory with read-only tools (read, grep, glob, list)
46	 *
47	 * For side effects (file writes, bash commands), configure tools and permissions explicitly.
